@startuml scenario-2
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

actor Student
participant "Grade Entry Page" as Config
participant "Career GPA Store" as Store

Student -> Config : Selects career and cohort
Config -> Store : Load terms (Commercial SE)\nor levels (ESP) of the cohort
Store --> Config : Return course list
Student -> Config : Sets or changes a course grade
Config -> Store : setGradeEntry(courseCode, entry)
Store -> Store : Persist update to localStorage
opt Failing grade on a course
  Config --> Student : Offer a retake, warn after two failed attempts\nand flag dismissal after the third
end
Config -> Config : calculateTermGpa(grades, term)
Config --> Student : Updated term or level GPA\n(Dean's List and President's List for Commercial SE only)
@enduml
